codex-session-*.md

# Task evidence debug symbols (regenerable; the reviewed binaries stay tracked)
.trellis/tasks/**/*.pdb

# Home dev-server dependency caches captured in task evidence (regenerable)
.trellis/tasks/**/vite-cache/

# Intermediate first-use journey runs stay local; only the final evidence runs are tracked
